{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_4000_situation", "source_sha256": "79215d8c69d06de62d3dfef8304a2c0596236d81472beff6ff4c15e861489fb1", "ja": "スポーツバラエティ　休憩中", "zh": "运动综艺节目　休息中", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_4000_place", "source_sha256": "56e74a077d09ef4752b1f8526584b501c9a5898a11c9bad7e09c8c74ef3562fd", "ja": "屋内競技場", "zh": "室内竞技场", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_4001_p", "source_sha256": "27000fcb5a0d699d4c91d7b0e2871fc57ac51a2d2f223a8feb23f688c150aa83", "ja": "（今日は、アイドル対抗バスケ大会。\n環の相手は、中学生か……。さすがに分が悪そうだな）", "zh": "（今天是偶像对抗篮球大赛，\n环的对手是国中生啊……状况实在是满不利的。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_4002_040tam", "source_sha256": "b0a96b3576fd2719d502a46703542f45170b4ed927a1b3624e1ace9cd1a59a34", "ja": "うう～っ！　たまき、いっぱい動いてるのに、\nぜんぶ止められちゃう……。", "zh": "呜呜～！环一直很努力跑动，\n但都被挡下来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_4003_040tam", "source_sha256": "a34e194db9c3a209d8048a6dabdb47cc1eca1f04aad471fe3282945880d29f4a", "ja": "このままじゃ、負けちゃうよ～！\nおやぶん！　たまき、どうしたらいいの！？", "zh": "这样下去就要输了啦～！\n老大！环该怎么办才好！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_4004_p", "source_sha256": "bb21bdb6ff0e937c9bc356d2e54a9f695490e19765d542fcd336b60af99b0ed4", "ja": "まぁまぁ、環。まずは……", "zh": "没事没事，环，首先得……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_4005", "source_sha256": "6b6ee75454339926151db70ef440c6d76265ec095c657a9fe08b332dd90a09b3", "ja": "落ち着くことだ", "zh": "冷静下来", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_4006", "source_sha256": "2d98cc5a3b559d5110f47d4c646176da6223e920b3cdfbf79a1c15d2dff8b67e", "ja": "あきらめないことだ", "zh": "不要放弃", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_4007", "source_sha256": "42ff27af8adccb375287fa38bd1f7254bd92851527bf20a6b2fd90d223ec4ed0", "ja": "俺を倒せ！", "zh": "打倒我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_4100_p", "source_sha256": "3d74019f76737bac7eba0fbfb80bb65ce92da41d9ec9f5dd51996873cf2d3d57", "ja": "落ちついて深呼吸だ。頭に血が上ったまま\n向かっていっても、点は取れないぞ？", "zh": "冷静下来，深呼吸。\n就算横冲直撞，也得不了分喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_4101_040tam", "source_sha256": "0b20b9cf5b74e951353b7e97c915575472be1bb124c4b40fe62ffbb7d4b6b3cb", "ja": "うう、深呼吸……。\nすー、はー、すー、はー……。", "zh": "呜呜，深呼吸……\n（吸气──吐气──吸气──吐气──）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_4102_040tam", "source_sha256": "8bb7f9e4be73029d8639ecf783ed10a119a35836c4eda6a42b1804d6b770716f", "ja": "なんか、頭がスーッてしてきた！\nたまき、これなら勝てるかも！", "zh": "总觉得脑袋变得清楚起来了！\n这样的话，环说不定能赢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_4103_040tam", "source_sha256": "5cb6165cb61fb04130eb29301551963c0686522160017d672190f262e31517b0", "ja": "やっぱり、おやぶんはすごいなー。\nありがとー、おやぶんっ！", "zh": "老大果然很厉害呢～\n谢谢你～老大！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_4200_p", "source_sha256": "5e5409c441321fb8c4690c3b30f383a8989132dbc600f3f127d1d14da2a856fb", "ja": "最後まで、諦めないことだ。\n環らしさを忘れずに、思いきりぶつかってこい！", "zh": "到最后都不要放弃。\n别忘了自己的特色，使出浑身解数攻击吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_4201_040tam", "source_sha256": "1ca9983b10f20d3ace0aaac6fd5792ae1ecc7481d78994b0e2bdcb06d8908c17", "ja": "うんっ！　たまき、ぜったい勝ちたい！\n……あ、そろそろ時間だ。行ってくるね！", "zh": "嗯！环一定要赢！\n……啊，时间差不多了，环先过去啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_4202_040tam", "source_sha256": "80cec982da1b8b1233c6d73fa349e960d12389a4db891d37cd5e30f36e56e08b", "ja": "おーい！　おやぶーんっ！", "zh": "喂──！老大──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_4203_040tam", "source_sha256": "14fd593700b7c9eb343344f34b6033f51d51c97453f933b5787c2e94ed92021a", "ja": "試合は負けちゃったけど……たまき、\nえむぶいぴー？って賞、もらったよ！　ほらっ♪", "zh": "虽然比赛输掉了……但是，环得到了一个叫\nMVP……？的奖喔！你看♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_4300_p", "source_sha256": "3e51c35b829a6794ff80d3165220ad04f489f4c7c5b24ecc7b455f9be742d9db", "ja": "試合の前に、この俺を倒してみせろ！\nさぁ、かかってこい、環……！", "zh": "在比赛前，先试着打倒我吧！\n来，尽管上吧，环……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_4301_040tam", "source_sha256": "2ddb74d0baee9bf504fd2c439a4ed366bb604e5213e745fb76e96380292373c8", "ja": "おお～！　さっすが、おやぶんっ！\nたまきを特訓してくれるんだねっ？", "zh": "喔喔～！不愧是老大！\n你要为环进行特训吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_4302_040tam", "source_sha256": "1d7948d7ece63419b097243da6d455b1f90434c9bae912962ab911cf49154512", "ja": "よ～し、いっくぞ～！！\n手かげんナシだからね！　くふふっ♪", "zh": "好～上啰～！！\n环是不会手下留情的喔！呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_4303_040tam", "source_sha256": "8697a98bbca3320fba02a7f99c0ea272d962faf84d6773493206919d067ce4d7", "ja": "おやぶんとバスケしてたら、スタッフの人に\n怒られちゃった……。ゴメンね、おやぶん……。", "zh": "因为和老大打篮球，环被工作人员\n骂了一顿……对不起，老大……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
